<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore oil stocks data to be released Wed - TDB.</title>
<headline>Singapore oil stocks data to be released Wed - TDB.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's Trade Development Board said it will release its weekly oil product stock figures later on Wednesday, a day earlier than usual, due to the Labour Day holiday on Thursday.</p>
<p>A TDB official said the figures would reflect the position for the week ended April 29 and would be released at around 1600 hours (0800GMT).</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
